FFmpeg master 4968cc472b72 (2026-10-10), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/4968cc472b724e52fc9fd405877f367b42db92cf

MJPEG of Avid (the tags AVRn and AVDJ, which mov maps to MJPEG too): a flipped
picture was flipped before the frame height and cropping of Avid were set, and
the flip read past the planes: a heap read overflow from a crafted upload.

